						"created":"2022-10-26T16:28:41.829966+02:00",
						"description":"**Rainbow Prism Glass**\r\n\r\n*A sleek glass shader with smooth rainbow-edge blending for a futuristic look.*  \r\n\r\n- Subtle iridescent highlights across glass surfaces  \r\n- Perfect for sci-fi, fantasy, and decorative renders  \r\n- Procedural setup allows full customization of colors and intensity  \r\n- Adds a modern, polished effect to transparent materials  \r\n\r\nIf this prism-inspired glass worked well in your project, consider dropping a quick rating\u2014it helps a lot!",
