						"category":"sheer",
						"created":"2025-06-20T18:03:07.984562+02:00",
						"description":"Physical material that renders exactly as in real life.\n\nBrand: Fabric Library\nWeight: 52\nEnd Use: Drapery\nUsable Width: 297\nDesign Type: Plain\nColour Type: Purple\nCharacteristics: Sheer\nComposition: 100% Polyester\nTwinbru Reference: This plain design drapery fabric features sheer characteristics and is available in a purple tone. Made from 100% Polyester, it has a usable width of 297 cm and a fabric weight of 52 g/m\u00b2. This is a plain fabric with no repeat. With a wear resistance of unspecified and certifications including OEKO-TEX 0611045, ISO 14001, B1 Germany, BS5867 part 2 type B, EN 13773, IMO FTPC PART 7, NFPA 701, NFPA 260, AATCC 96, CAL 117, CAN/ULC S109 large flame, CAN/ULC S109 small flame, Oeko-Tex 0611045, it is a reliable option for both residential and commercial interiors. Most Fabric Library fabrics meet fire safety standards, making them especially suited for contract applications. Fabric Library offers high-quality, decorative drapery fabrics that meet the latest environmental standards. Luxuriously soft and fully washable, they are OEKO-TEX\u00ae certified and made to enhance both style and comfort.",
