						"description":"The Procedural Packed Snow texture replicates the appearance of snow that has been compressed and compacted due to pressure or melting and refreezing. This texture captures the smooth and dense quality of packed snow, making it ideal for creating realistic winter landscapes, mountain scenes, or any project requiring a representation of tightly-packed snow surfaces.",
