						"description":"A toon shader with noise between the different shades!\r\n\r\nHOW TO USE! :\r\n- make sure you're on EEVEE\r\n- add a light source or HDRI (a single point light will work best)\r\n\r\n\u2022  the contrast slider will change the  \"gradient\" between the lightest and darkest shades\r\n\u2022   the hue slider changes the color of the texture\r\n\u2022   the saturation slider changes the saturation of the texture\r\n\u2022   the noise slider changes the amount of noise between each gradient value",
