						"created":"2025-02-23T18:39:01.129722+01:00",
						"description":"Procedural Base Spiral Texture helps to create spiral textures almost effortlessly. It produces color gradient (from 0.0 to 1.0) between each thread (if there are 2 or more threads used) or the thread's turn (if there is only 1 thread used).\r\n\r\n**Note:** Add the Color Ramp node and play with the color swatches to see different results.\r\n\r\n*b* \u2013 scaling factor or proportionality constant.\r\n\r\n*Threads* \u2013 number of separate threads.\r\n\r\n*Clockwise* \u2013 direction of the spiral.",
