						"description":"**Iridescent Rainbow Gradient**\r\n\r\n*A vibrant shifting gradient with bold multicolor transitions.*  \r\n\r\n- Perfect for stylized props, abstract art, and playful renders  \r\n- Fully procedural for seamless adjustments and variations  \r\n- Adds a striking, modern look to creative projects  \r\n- Works beautifully in both stills and animations  \r\n\r\nIf this colorful shader adds to your work, a quick rating would really support me as a designer.",
